From f5465edde7af338f17848229a650253ff3d20499 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Javier Maestro <jjmaestro@ieee.org>
Date: Sat, 4 Apr 2026 13:40:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/14] feat: add download_archives module extension

User-facing entry point for per-version lazy downloads. Creates an
index repo plus one download repo per version, so archives are only
fetched when a build references a specific version.

The `archives()` function implementing the extension's `archives` tag,
is public so other module extensions can reuse the same two-phase
pattern directly.
